{"id":"kassette","lemma":"Kassette","pos":"noun","rank":4833,"glosses":["cassette","coffer"],"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/7/77/De-Kassette.ogg/De-Kassette.ogg.mp3","gender":"f","forms":{"genitive":"Kassette","plural":"Kassetten"},"examples":[{"text":"Ich kaufe Kassetten.","en":"I buy tapes.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to buy, to purchase","l":"kaufen"},null]},{"text":"Lass uns die Kassette anhören.","en":"Let's listen to the tape.","words":[{"g":"to allow","l":"lassen"},{"g":"us","l":"wir"},{"g":"the"},null,{"g":"to listen to the end"}]},{"text":"Immer wenn ich traurig bin, höre ich alte Kassetten von früher.","en":"Whenever I'm sad, I listen to old tapes from the past.","words":[null,null,{"g":"I"},{"g":"sadly"},{"g":"am","l":"sein"},{"g":"to hear through the ear)","l":"hören"},{"g":"I"},{"g":"age, old age","l":"Alter"},null,{"g":"from / of"},{"g":"formerly, in the past"}],"phrases":[[0,2,"every time, whenever"]]},{"text":"Lasst uns die Kassette anhören.","en":"Let's listen to the tape.","words":[{"g":"to allow","l":"lassen"},{"g":"us","l":"wir"},{"g":"the"},null,{"g":"to listen to the end"}]},{"text":"Ich hatte mein Portemonnaie verloren, darum konnte ich die Kassette nicht kaufen.","en":"I had lost my purse, so I couldn't buy the cassette.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to have","l":"haben"},{"g":"my"},{"g":"wallet, purse"},{"g":"lost, missing"},{"g":"around it, around that"},{"g":"can, to be able to","l":"können"},{"g":"I"},{"g":"the"},null,{"g":"not"},{"g":"to buy, to purchase"}]}]}